  "description": "Redis distributed lock provider implementing IDistributedLockProvider for the EricksonLopez platform using StackExchange.Redis with Lua scripts for atomic release and lease renewals. Features zero-allocation error handling and OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Native AOT compatibility is subject to StackExchange.Redis AOT support for the specific version in use.",
